sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Controller browser
  participant G as Live session coordinator
  participant C as Serialized command coordinator
  participant T as Omega Z FTMS control point
  participant R as Read-only telemetry
  B->>G: Hold completes with operation, lease, expected version
  G->>G: Bind session state and connection generation
  G->>C: Submit four-second single-use intent
  C->>C: Consume operation and verify exact hardware capability
  C->>T: Request Control 00
  T-->>C: Response 80 00 result
  C->>C: Recheck lease, state, expiry, generation, stopped belt
  C->>T: Start 07 or Stop 08 01 once
  T-->>C: Matching FTMS response
  T-->>R: Fresh measured speed telemetry
  R-->>C: Generation-bound measurement
  C-->>G: Confirmed, Rejected, or Unknown
  G-->>B: Persistent result and authoritative session snapshot
  Note over C,T: Timeout after the motion write is Unknown and is never retried
